   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women for Women International (UK)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resourcing the Movement: Transforming Feminist Funding in Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this three-year grant is that grassroots, women-led, feminist civil society organisations (CSOs), and Women&#x2019;s rights organizations (WROs) across federal Iraq and the Kurdistan Region of Iraq are empowered and interconnected to advance a localised and transformative Women Peace and Security (WPS) agenda, sustain progress towards women&#x2019;s rights and equality, and foster women&#x2019;s meaningful participation in society and decision making at local and national levels for  inclusive peace and security.</narrative>
  </description>
